      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Understanding the core financial drivers of long-distance relocation is essential for budgeting accurately. When moving goods from Hyderabad to Nagpur, the primary determinant is the total consignment volume, measured in cubic feet (CFT).</p>
