      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Eliminating Hidden Surcharges &amp; Demanding Written Binding Contracts for Bike Transport from Hyderabad</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When hiring packers and movers from Hyderabad to Nagpur, it's essential to be aware of potential dishonest practices that can inflate the cost of your move. One common tactic used by unscrupulous transporters is adding moving-day surcharges for floor elevations, long carries, or toll taxes.</p>
<p>These surcharges can significantly increase the overall cost of your move, leaving you with a hefty bill that you didn't anticipate.</p>

<p>To avoid such surprises, it's crucial to obtain a transparent written binding quote from your packers and movers. A written binding quote outlines the total cost of the move, including all services and charges, providing you with a clear understanding of what you'll be paying. This quote should include details such as:</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
